WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.454
Three hundred and eighty-two entities.

00:00:02.454 --> 00:00:06.420
Six thousand, eight hundred and two documented connections.

00:00:06.420 --> 00:00:14.113
Five investigative data vectors: lobbying records, the treason roster, the OSINT vault, financial analysis, and court records.

00:00:14.113 --> 00:00:16.568
Every connection sourced from public records.

00:00:16.568 --> 00:00:22.522
The network analysis spans political actors, financial donors, foreign agents, and Canadian officials.

00:00:22.522 --> 00:00:31.681
The complexity requires computational analysis — no human could manually trace six thousand, eight hundred connections across three hundred and eighty-two nodes.

00:00:31.681 --> 00:00:33.636
This is not a conspiracy board.

00:00:33.636 --> 00:00:35.227
It is a graph database.

00:00:35.227 --> 00:00:37.738
Every edge is a documented interaction.

00:00:37.738 --> 00:00:39.806
Every node is a named entity.

00:00:39.806 --> 00:00:42.715
The government publishes the data in separate silos.

00:00:42.715 --> 00:00:44.329
We connected the silos.

00:00:44.329 --> 00:00:45.977
The map drew itself.
